        <mxCell id="mapblock" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;Column mapping: div1.dbo.tblWell &amp;#8594; Databricks Unity Catalog&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;margin:6px 0 8px 0'&gt;Source: &lt;b&gt;enverus.direct_access_v3.foundations_wellheader&lt;/b&gt; (6,184,921 rows) · mirror &lt;b&gt;cts_deltasharing_da_prod.direct_access_v3.foundations_wellheader&lt;/b&gt;. Match key &lt;b&gt;API10&lt;/b&gt;: UPP.API = LEFT(ApiNo,10) &amp;#8801; LEFT(API_UWI_Unformatted,10). &lt;b style='color:#f0c9a6'&gt;daapUnitID&lt;/b&gt; comes from div1.dbo.tblDaapUnit (not in DA V3) &amp;#8594; replaced by the new Hendrix unit-id sequence.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#161b24'&gt;&lt;th style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:14%'&gt;tblWell column&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:7%'&gt;Type&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:29%'&gt;Consumed by&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:20%'&gt;foundations_wellheader&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:30%'&gt;Note&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:transparent'&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;&lt;b&gt;uwi&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;str&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;producer, wellid-updates, daapID-update (match to UPP.API)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#a6d8c0'&gt;LEFT(API_UWI_Unformatted,10)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#e6cfa6'&gt;The real join key (API10). API_UWI formatted = 42-485-E8473.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#12151c'&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;&lt;b&gt;WellID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;int&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;producer join; wellid/daap join to tblDaapUnit; backfill UPP.WellID&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#a6d8c0'&gt;WellID (LONG)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#e6cfa6'&gt;&amp;#9888; Different id space (DA V3 = 15-digit DAAP id). Re-key on API10.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:transparent'&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Created&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;datetime&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;wellid/daap &quot;new well since&quot; filter&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#a6d8c0'&gt;&amp;#8212; none &amp;#8212;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#e6cfa6'&gt;&amp;#9888; No creation date. Use UpdatedDate or core_wells.envcompinserteddate.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#12151c'&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;&lt;b&gt;StateID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;int FK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;producer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#a6d8c0'&gt;StateProvince (TX)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#e6cfa6'&gt;id&amp;#8594;name: DA V3 gives the resolved string; drop DIV1 lookup.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:transparent'&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CountyID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;int FK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;producer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#a6d8c0'&gt;County (WICHITA)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#e6cfa6'&gt;id&amp;#8594;name&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#12151c'&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;&lt;b&gt;AbstractID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;int FK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;producer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#a6d8c0'&gt;Abstract&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;color:#e6cfa6'&gt;id&amp;#8594;name&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:transparent'&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:4px 7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top'&gt;&lt;b&gt;wellStatusID&lt;/b&gt